he English section and did not add unrelated content.\n\nOverall, the agent satisfies the primary intent: it reports all required fields in the requested categories, apparently matching the English entry, and stops appropriately. The only concern is the strict \u201cexactly as displayed\u201d requirement for the Arabic script/romanization, but absent clear screenshot contradiction, this does not rise to a confirmed critical failure.",
